    prompt: "Insertion sort's invariant: everything before the cursor is already sorted. Each step inserts one value into that sorted prefix by shifting larger values right.\n\nSort `values` ascending using insertion sort and return the list. Do not call `sort` or `sorted` — the point is the invariant and the data movement.",
    exportName: "insertion_sort",
