    prompt: "Preorder sends work downward, postorder combines finished children, and **inorder visits between the two children** — which is what exposes sorted order in a BST.\n\nReturn the inorder traversal of the tree as a list of values.\n\nA tree node has `.value`, `.left` and `.right`; an empty tree is `None`.",
