    prompt: "Divide and conquer on a tree is one sentence: state what the call returns, choose the empty answer, then trust both smaller calls and combine.\n\nReturn the number of **leaves** — nodes with no children. The empty tree has `0`.\n\nA tree node has `.value`, `.left` and `.right`; an empty tree is `None`.",
