    estimatedMinutes: 12,
    prompt: "Reproducibility comes from recording seeds and passing generator objects explicitly, rather than relying on hidden global state.\n\nImplement a linear congruential generator. Starting from `seed`, repeat `state = (1103515245 * state + 12345) % 2147483648` and collect `count` values, each **after** an update.\n\nThe same seed must always produce the same sequence — that is the whole point.",
    exportName: "lcg_sequence",
    scaffolds: { L1: "def lcg_sequence(seed, count):\n    pass", L2: "def lcg_sequence(seed, count):\n    pass", L3: "def lcg_sequence(seed, count):\n    pass", L4: "" },
