    prompt: "Paradigms are told apart by their **feedback signal**, not their algorithms. Labelled targets mean supervised; no targets means unsupervised; a reward from an environment means reinforcement.\n\nGiven `has_labels` and `has_reward`, return `\"supervised\"`, `\"reinforcement\"` or `\"unsupervised\"`. A reward signal takes precedence when both are present.",
    exportName: "paradigm",
