    solution: "def project_roles(tokens, w_query, w_key, w_value):\n    if not tokens:\n        return ([], [], [])\n    width = len(tokens[0])\n    for matrix in (w_query, w_key, w_value):\n        if len(matrix) != width:\n            raise ValueError('matrix does not match the token width')\n\n    def project(vector, matrix):\n        return [round(sum(v * row[j] for v, row in zip(vector, matrix)), 6)\n                for j in range(len(matrix[0]))]\n\n    return ([project(t, w_query) for t in tokens],\n            [project(t, w_key) for t in tokens],\n            [project(t, w_value) for t in tokens])",
