    prompt: "Return `(static, contextual)` for a word with two senses.\n\n`static` is the average of the two sense vectors, which is what a single-row table would learn. `contextual` is a list pairing each context with the blend `weight * static + (1 - weight) * context`, rounded to six places.\n\nThe static vector sits between the senses and matches neither well. Raise `ValueError` when the weight falls outside zero to one or the widths disagree.",
