    prompt: "Return `(exposure, blast_radius, saved)` for a staged rollout.\n\n`exposure` maps each stage name to the number of daily requests whose answers come from the new version. Shadow is the only stage where a wrong answer reaches nobody.\n\n`blast_radius` is the requests affected during an incident, which is the request rate times detection plus recovery time. `saved` is what a preloaded rollback avoids. Raise `ValueError` on a share outside zero to one.",
